thoughtrecipe nested_delegate
"Nested delegation: a delegate whose body delegates again. CHARACTERIZATION OF CURRENT (LOSSY) BEHAVIOR: lowering keeps only the outermost delegate and SILENTLY DROPS inner delegates (no warning), despite the language guide claiming nested delegation is supported. This golden pins that behavior so any change (fix or regression) in Slice 4/5 is caught."

trigger as capability:
  may read workspace

agent router uses react
agent reviewer uses react
agent writer uses planner

delegate to router:
  from input.prompt
  goal "Route the request to the right specialist."
  delegate to reviewer:
    from state.routing
    goal "Review the routed findings."
    delegate to writer:
      from state.review
      goal "Write up the reviewed findings."
      capture result -> state.report
